## 1. Web Portal Overview

### 1.1 Purpose

The ASP.NET Core web portal serves as the **central management dashboard** for Mangojane Funeral Parlor administrators. It provides real-time operational visibility and control over:

- Booking processing and approval
- Resource (hearse, driver, equipment) allocation
- Policy and payment management
- Daily dispatch reporting

### 1.2 Target Users

| User Type | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| **Manager** | Full access: Approve bookings, manage resources, view reports |
| **Dispatcher** | Schedule assets, view schedules, update statuses |
| **Front-Desk** | View bookings, log payments, search policies |
| **Management** | Monitor KPIs, audit logs, revenue reports |

### 1.3 Portal Objectives

| Objective | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| **Real-time Visibility** | Admin sees booking requests immediately after client submits |
| **Conflict Prevention** | System prevents double-booking of hearses and equipment |
| **Efficient Processing** | Quick approval/rejection workflow for bookings |
| **Policy Management** | Easy search and verification of burial society records |
| **Operational Reporting** | Generate daily schedules for staff |

