## 2. Stakeholder Needs (Web-Specific)

Based on stakeholder interviews and confirmation (Appendix A & B of SRS):

| Need | Importance | How Web Portal Addresses It |
|------|------------|----------------------------|
| Eliminate paper diary double-bookings | CRITICAL | Calendar view with conflict detection |
| Quickly verify policy status | HIGH | Searchable policy database |
| Real-time service schedule visibility | HIGH | Live dashboard with all bookings |
| Easy payment logging | MEDIUM | Payment recording form with receipts |
| Staff coordination | MEDIUM | Daily dispatch schedule reports |
| Data privacy (POPIA compliance) | CRITICAL | Role-based access, SSL encryption |

