## 3. Functional Requirements (FR5-FR8)

### FR5: Admin Booking Approval/Rejection

| Requirement | Description | Priority |
|-------------|-------------|----------|
| FR5.1 | Display incoming booking requests in a sortable table | MUST HAVE |
| FR5.2 | Show client name, package, preferred date, and status | MUST HAVE |
| FR5.3 | Allow administrators to approve, reject, or modify bookings | MUST HAVE |
| FR5.4 | Send status update notifications to Flutter app via Supabase | MUST HAVE |
| FR5.5 | Track who approved/rejected and timestamp | SHOULD HAVE |

**User Flow:**
1. Admin logs into web portal
2. Sees pending bookings in the dashboard queue
3. Clicks on a booking to view details
4. Reviews client information and package details
5. Approves (status: "Approved") or Rejects (status: "Rejected")
6. System sends real-time update to client's mobile app

### FR6: Asset (Hearse/Equipment) Scheduling

| Requirement | Description | Priority |
|-------------|-------------|----------|
| FR6.1 | Assign hearses, drivers, and equipment to approved bookings | MUST HAVE |
| FR6.2 | Visual calendar with conflict detection | MUST HAVE |
| FR6.3 | Prevent double-booking of resources for same time slot | MUST HAVE |
| FR6.4 | Display availability of resources | MUST HAVE |
| FR6.5 | Allow manual override (with reason field) | SHOULD HAVE |

**Asset Types:**
| Asset Type | Description | Quantity (Example) |
|------------|-------------|-------------------|
| Hearse | Vehicle for transporting deceased | 2 |
| Family Car | Vehicle for family transportation | 2 |
| Tent | Service tent for burial site | 3 |
| Lowering Equipment | Equipment for lowering casket | 2 |
| Chairs | Seating for funeral service | 50 |
| Staff | Drivers, mortuary staff | 4 |

### FR7: Policy and Payment Management

| Requirement | Description | Priority |
|-------------|-------------|----------|
| FR7.1 | Search burial society policies by policy number or name | MUST HAVE |
| FR7.2 | View policy status and payment history | MUST HAVE |
| FR7.3 | Log premium payments | MUST HAVE |
| FR7.4 | Generate payment receipt (PDF) | SHOULD HAVE |
| FR7.5 | Track outstanding payments | COULD HAVE |

**Policy Information:**
| Field | Description |
|-------|-------------|
| Policy Number | Unique identifier |
| Policyholder Name | Full name of the policyholder |
| Policy Type | Full, Partial, Premium |
| Status | Active, Lapsed, Closed |
| Payment History | Date, Amount, Method |
| Outstanding Balance | Any amount overdue |

### FR8: Daily Dispatch Reports

| Requirement | Description | Priority |
|-------------|-------------|----------|
| FR8.1 | Generate PDF reports for staff | SHOULD HAVE |
| FR8.2 | Include: Hearse assignments, driver schedules, cemetery locations | SHOULD HAVE |
| FR8.3 | Available for printing or mobile viewing | SHOULD HAVE |
| FR8.4 | Export to PDF format | SHOULD HAVE |
| FR8.5 | Email report to staff | COULD HAVE |

