## 4. Admin User Roles

### 4.1 Role Definitions

| Role | Access Level | Permissions |
|------|--------------|-------------|
| **Super Admin** | Full | All CRUD operations, user management, system settings |
| **Manager** | High | Approve/reject bookings, manage assets, view all reports |
| **Dispatcher** | Medium | Assign assets, view schedules, update booking statuses |
| **Front-Desk** | Limited | View bookings, log payments, search policies |
| **View Only** | Restricted | View reports only, no editing |

